{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Then <STYLE ID="3">Haruka's</STYLE> phone rang.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Who's that? At this hour..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
